   :now "Murakumo Meter 2fb6a906 and independent Engi 45b79089 are live with separate Keychain-custodied Ed25519 keys and an APAC D1 append-only/replay-fenced ledger. A real 10-modality fleet witness produced run CID bafkreigt, metering receipt bafkreiel and Engi transfer CID bafkreic2. Nexus-x402 09980045 verifies both role-bound signatures and registry-binds price/network/asset/payTo before Base RPC. Kotoba/WASM battery 8/8, CLJS 2 tests/16 assertions, Engi 6 tests and Nexus 26 tests/102 assertions are green. Only one real confirmed Base USDC transaction remains"
   :target "one run CID -> metering receipt -> Engi entry -> x402 settlement/reconciliation"}
  {:gap/id :fleet-production-coverage :severity :medium :status :complete
   :now "gad production runner is live on Radeon 8060S/48GiB ROCm with health-advertised capabilities; its API source, 77-package environment and every configured runner are SHA-256 identified, and the remote artifact ledger rehash-verifies successful content-addressed outputs for all 10 required modalities: image, 3d, rig, motion, effect, vrm-compose, music, sfx, voice and video"
   :target "capability-labelled runners, reproducible images and per-modality live witnesses"}
  {:gap/id :public-fabric-dashboard :severity :medium :status :complete
   :now "redacted live JSON exposes freshness, checkout summary, gap state, runtime probes, exact kaizen CI state, Nexus settlement count/USD, governed post activity and content-addressed rollback state"
