   :now "shared WIP remains inventoried and untouched; unattended production deploy now runs only from Git HEAD archives plus a content-addressed overlay allowlist, archives every local dependency at an exact HEAD, compiles under the build lock, deploys under the deploy lock, records artifact SHA-256 receipt, and removes its isolated temporary checkout"
